.com/content/oncorwww/us/en/home/about-us/transmission-systems/current-transmission-line-projects/ranger-camp-to-tonkawa-345-kV-transmission-line-project.html]]></description><Point><coordinates>-100.682,32.543</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Liggett Switch</name><styleUrl>#sub</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[project_id: oncor-liggett-to-skyview<br>project: Liggett to Skyview<br>kv: 345<br>stage: 3<br>window: Open now<br>substation: Liggett Switch<br>county: TX: Dallas<br>location_quality: exact<br>how_placed: Oncor: south of and adjacent to W Rock Island Rd, 1/4 mi east of Roy Orr Blvd; OSM junction (32.8161,-97.0304) offset 1/4 mi east.<br>source: https://www.oncor.com/content/oncorwww/us/en/home/about-us/transmission-systems/current-transmission-line-projects/liggett-switch-to-skyview-switch-345-kv-transmission-line-projec.html]]></description><Point><coordinates>-97.026,32.815</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Skyview Switch</name><styleUrl>#sub</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[project_id: oncor-liggett-to-skyview<br>project: Liggett to Skyview<br>kv: 345<br>stage: 3<br>window: Open now<br>substation: Skyview Switch<br>county: TX: Tarrant<br>location_quality: approx<br>how_placed: Oncor: 1/4 mi SW of Trinity Blvd &amp; SH 360 in Fort Worth; junction found by OSM reverse geocoding (~32.822,-97.062), then offset 1/4 mi SW.<br>source: https://www.oncor.com/content/oncorwww/us/en/home/about-us/transmission-systems/current-transmission-line-projects/liggett-switch-to-skyview-switch-345-kv-transmission-line-projec.html]]></description><Point><coordinates>-97.065,32.8195</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ranger Camp Switch</name><styleUrl>#sub</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[project_id: oncor-ranger-camp-to-midland-east<br>project: Ranger Camp to Midland East<br>kv: 345<br>stage: 3<br>window: Open now<br>substation: Ranger Camp Switch<br>county: TX: Mitchell<br>location_quality: approx<br>how_placed: Same site as in the 